.TH MOUSAM 1 "November 2026" "mousam" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
mousam \- weather at a glance
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mousam
.RI [ OPTION ...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B Mousam
is a weather app for the GNOME desktop. It shows the current conditions,
hourly, tomorrow and 7-day forecasts, air quality and the sun and moon for
your saved locations. Weather data comes from Open-Meteo.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show help options.
.TP
.B \-\-help\-all
Show all help options.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.cache/mousam/mousam.log
Log file, written when debug mode is on in Preferences.
.SH SEE ALSO
https://github.com/amit9838/mousam
